ile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature2.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;block md:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob1.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/section&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;section class=&quot;relative&quot; id=&quot;part-three&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;hidden md:block md:relative&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature3-1.webp&quot; \/&gt; &lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature3-2.webp&quot; \/&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;absolute top-[5%] block w-full px-[129px] text-center&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[#c5c5c5] text-[5.5rem] font-bold leading-tight&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Look Sharp&lt;br \/&gt;\r\nFeel Smooth&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;text-black text-[15px] my-[43px] mx-[115px] leading-[1.2]&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;The XANON X1 Ultra blends performance with elegance. The curved-edge body with a matte stone texture in Millstone Grey, Thyme Green, and Riverbed Black delivers a bold statement \u2014 sleek to hold, stunning to see.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;block md:hidden&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bg-[url('https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob3-1.webp')] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat py-[50px] px-[30px] text-center text-black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-center text-[1.8rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#d1d1d1]&quot;&g