t-bold text-[#cdb19b] !leading-[2cm]&quot;&gt; LED Flash &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob12-2.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/section&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;section class=&quot;relative&quot; id=&quot;part-thirteen&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Desktop View --&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;hidden md:block md:relative&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature13.webp&quot; \/&gt; &lt;!-- FIXED: Flexbox column layout ensures clean, vertical spacing stack --&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;absolute inset-x-0 top-[6%] flex flex-col items-center px-[129px] text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- FIXED: Added leading-[1.1] to separate the lines cleanly --&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[5.5rem] font-bold text-[#cedfcb] leading-[1.1]&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Stereo Sound,&lt;br \/&gt;\r\nMore Impact&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- FIXED: Replaced rigid horizontal margins with max-w-[720px] --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;mt-6 max-w-[720px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Immersive stereo sound provides a fuller audio experience, whether you're watching content or listening to music. It's clear, crisp, and well balanced.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- Mobile View --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;block md:hidden&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bg-[url('https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob13-1.webp')] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat py-[50px] px-[30px] text-black text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- FIXED: Added leading-tight here too just to be safe on small screens --&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-center text-[2.5rem] font-bold text-[#cedecb] leading-tight&quot;&gt;Stereo Sound,&lt;br \/&gt;\r\nMore Impact&lt;\/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;pb-0 pl-[23px] pr-[32px] pt-[18px] text-center text-[14px] text-black&quot;&gt;Immersive stereo sound provides a fuller audio experience, whether you're watching content or listening to music. It's clear, crisp, and well balanced.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob13-2.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/section&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;section class=&quot;relative&quot; id=&quot;part-fourteen&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;hidden md:block md:relative&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature14.webp&quot; \/&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;absolute inset-x-0 top-[7%] flex flex-col items-center px-[129px] text-center&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[5.8rem] font-bold text-[#eae6e3] leading-[1.1]&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Z-AXIS Motor +&lt;br \/&gt;\r\nGYROSCOPE&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;mt-6 max-w-[850px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Whether you're gaming or typing, the Z-axis motor provides additional force feedback for a more realistic experience. The gyroscope provides exact orientation, allowing you to win every game.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;block md:hidden&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bg-[url('https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob14-1.webp')] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat py-[50px] px-[30px] text-black text-center&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-center text-[2.3rem] font-bold text-[#eae7e2] leading-tight&quot;&gt;Z-AXIS Motor +&lt;br \/&gt;\r\nGYROSCOPE&lt;\/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;mt-4 px-2 text-black text-[14px]&quot;&gt;Whether you're gaming or typing, the Z-axis motor provides additional force feedback for a more realistic experience. The gyroscope provides exact orientation, allowing you to win every game.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob14-2.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/section&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;section class=&quot;w-full&quot; id=&quot;part-fifteen&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Desktop View --&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;hidden md:block&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- 1. Headings First --&gt;&lt;!-- Reduced py-12 to py-6 --&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;px-[175px] pt-12 pb-6&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;flex flex-col items-start&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[#d7e2d5] font-bold text-[3.9rem] leading-none&quot;&gt;360\u00b0 Surround Antenna&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[#badfc2] font-bold text-[8.9rem] leading-[0.9]&quot;&gt;Zero Lag&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- 2. Image Second --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;360 Surround Antenna&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature15.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- 3. Text Last --&gt;&lt;!-- Reduced py-12 to py-4 --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;px-[175px] py-4 flex w-full&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;w-5\/12&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- Spacer --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;w-7\/12 text-right&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;text-[15px] text-black leading-[1.2]&quot;&gt;The dual Wi-Fi antennas allow you to swiftly switch to another unrestricted antenna while gaming with both hands on the phone. GPS antennas significantly increase mobile network performance and GPS signal.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- Mobile View --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;block md:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- 1. Headings First --&gt;&lt;!-- Reduced pt-[50px] to pt-[30px] --&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bg-[url('https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob15-1.webp')] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat pt-[30px] px-[30px] text-center&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;text-[#d7e1d6] text-[2rem] font-bold&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;360\u00b0 Surround Antenna&lt;\/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h4 class=&quot;text-[#badec2] text-[4rem] font-bold pb-[10px]&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Zero Lag&lt;\/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- 2. Image Second --&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Antenna Detail&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob15-2.webp&quot; \/&gt; &lt;!-- 3. Text Last --&gt; &lt;!-- Reduced pb-[50px] to pb-[20px] --&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bg-[url('https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob15-1.webp')] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat pb-[20px] px-[30px] text-center&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;text-[14px] text-black leading-normal&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;The dual Wi-Fi antennas allow you to swiftly switch to another unrestricted antenna while gaming with both hands on the phone. GPS antennas significantly increase mobile network performance and GPS signal.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/section&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;section class=&quot;relative&quot; id=&quot;part-sixteen&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Desktop View --&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;hidden md:block w-full&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;px-[123px] pt-12 pb-6&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[5.7rem] font-bold text-[#d7e2d5] leading-tight&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;3 Years Battery&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[5.7rem] font-bold text-[#d7e2d5] leading-tight&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Performance Assurance&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;3 Years Battery Performance&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature16.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;px-[123px] py-6&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Reduced py-12 to py-6 --&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;flex justify-between items-start&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;max-w-[45%] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Stay powered throughout your day with a large 5000mAh battery. And when it's time to recharge, 33W fast charging gets you back to 50% charge within 30 mins\u2014using a convenient Type-C to C cable.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[1.3rem] font-bold text-black&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;USB Type-C To C&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- Mobile View --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;block md:hidden text-center pt-[30px] pb-[10px]&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Reduced pt and pb --&gt;&lt;!-- 1. Headings First --&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;text-[2rem] font-bold text-[#d8e2d6] leading-tight px-4&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;3 Years Battery&lt;br \/&gt;\r\nPerformance Assurance&lt;\/h5&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- 2. Image Second --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;my-2&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Reduced my-6 to my-2 --&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Battery Detail&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature16.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- 3. Text and USB label Third --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;mt-2 px-[30px] text-[14px] leading-normal text-black&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Stay powered throughout your day with a large 5000mAh battery. And when it's time to recharge, 33W fast charging gets you back to 50% charge within 30 mins \u2014 using a convenient Type-C to C cable.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h4 class=&quot;mt-2 text-[1.45rem] font-bold text-black&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;USB Type-C To C&lt;\/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;!-- Reduced mt-6 to mt-2 --&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/section&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;section class=&quot;relative&quot; id=&quot;part-seventeen&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;hidden md:block md:relative&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Smart Unlock &amp;amp; Security&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/large-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature17.webp&quot; \/&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;absolute top-[8%] left-0 w-full text-center px-4&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-[3.8rem] font-bold text-[#d7e2d5]&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Smart Unlock &amp;amp; Security&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;mx-[200px] mb-[15px] mt-[29px] text-[15px] leading-[1.2] text-[#26354c]&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot;&gt;Stay secure with instant unlocking via fingerprint or face. Your data stays protected with built-in theft protection and remote lock features.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;block md:hidden&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;bg-[url('https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob17-1.webp')] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat pt-[50px] pb-[20px] text-center&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-center text-[1.78rem] font-bold text-[#d8e2d6]&quot;&gt;Smart Unlock &amp;amp; Security&lt;\/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;pb-0 pl-[26px] pr-[41px] pt-[17px] text-[14px] text-[#596373]&quot;&gt;Stay secure with instant unlocking via fingerprint or face. Your data stays protected with built-in theft protection and remote lock features.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;img alt=&quot;Security View&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/feature\/mobile-view\/xanon-x1-ultra_feature_mob17-2.webp&quot; \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n&lt;\/section&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;section class=&quot;w-full bg-white overflow-hidden&quot; id=&quot;part-eighteen&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;hidden md:block w-full&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;pt-16 pb-0 text-center&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;animate__animated animate__fadeInUp text-[6rem] font-extrabold uppercase leading-none text-[#d4e4ec] tracking-wide select-none&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot; data-aos-duration=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;Durable By Design&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;animate__animated animate__fadeInUp text-[2.8rem] font-bold text-black mt-2 leading-snug&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot; data-aos-delay=&quot;300&quot; data-aos-duration=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;IP53 Rated&lt;\/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;animate__animated animate__fadeInUp text-[1.65rem] font-semibold text-black mt-1 mb-10&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot; data-aos-delay=&quot;500&quot; data-aos-duration=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;Drop, Scratch &amp;amp; Heat Tested&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;\/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;animate__animated animate__fadeInUp w-full flex justify-center px-0&quot; data-aos=&quot;fade-up&quot; data-aos-delay=&quot;600&quot; data-aos-duration=&quot;1200&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;w-full max-w-[80%] rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden relative&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;XANON X1 Ultra \u2013 Durable By Design&quot; class=&quot;w-full h-auto object-cover&quot; src=&quot;https:\/\/waltonbd.com\/image\/catalog\/mobile\/smart-phone\/xanon-x1-ultra\/fea